                        "glosses": [
                            "Wikimedia Foundation (“維基媒體基金會”) 之首字母縮略詞"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf44a684-4fcd-4533-8b00-ce43774d6207",
                                "sense_id": "e6439e45-6bc8-32f2-954a-7629f58afb09",
                                "text": "“WMF has operated in the past without staffing and with very minimal staffing, so clearly it’s _possible_^([sic]) to host a high traffic website on an absolute shoestring,” acknowledged the Foundation’s then VP of engineering, Erik Möller, in 2013.",
                                "translation": "2013年，基金会当时的工程副总裁 Erik Möller 承认：“維基媒體基金會过去一直在没有员工或人员配备极少的情况下运营，因此显然可以用极少的资金来托管一个高流量网站。”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "820965b7-d83a-35dc-b2e4-ad1153d13043",
                        "entry_id": "18a2fa85-f451-35b8-8414-2147f8bf9456",
                        "glosses": [
                            "World Monuments Fund (“世界文化遺產基金會”) 之首字母縮略詞"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77d83cc6-9bc1-46c2-9bbb-9bd9a49b980e",
                                "sense_id": "820965b7-d83a-35dc-b2e4-ad1153d13043",
                                "text": "Every two years, the WMF adds new spots to its watch list, bringing awareness and helping garner funds for the sites’ ongoing protection.",
                                "translation": "每两年，世界文化遗产基金会都会将新的景点添加到其观察名单中，以提高人们的认识并帮助筹集资金以用于这些景点的持续保护。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
